{"title":"The Genius Who Sees Through the World","synopsis":"Shin Woo-jin, yang diculik saat masih kecil, dikurung di gudang dan diperbudak, secara dramatis diselamatkan dan dibawa keluar ke dunia… Shin Woo-jin mengamati ekspresi wajah dan bahasa non-verbal orang untuk menembus pikiran dan pikiran mereka. Dia mempelajari dunia melalui kemampuannya yang seperti profiler dan pengamatannya yang seperti Sherlock. Hal favorit Woo-jin adalah makanan, dan mimpinya adalah hidup normal. Tapi dunia tidak akan membiarkannya hidup normal…","alternative_title":"천재, 세상을 읽다","author":"Jeong Yong","artist":"Kim In Joong","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Psychological","Tragedy"],"chapters":[{"id":"c5b36943-a295-4713-a3da-424f06a84b33","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"8b4a761f-236b-48e4-acae-8b7047d64013","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"7d84a3a4-af0c-4125-98b9-bb5165a17aa7","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"id":"f4e7db8a-c3fe-4b85-8bc5-c79f985a03fa","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"daa6adaf-4653-49d9-bcab-bcaa267c0634","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-05-24","images":[]},{"id":"c7734f2e-4432-4a5a-b1e7-697c5c315fb7","number":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"fba4eff7-f293-4921-bccf-3a4c4b98c782","number":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"28b17f8b-6f01-4b04-a260-6cf755eb8a6d","number":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"7b182f7e-c31a-44d7-9159-5ba2a07c31be","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-02-22","images":[]},{"id":"291fd80e-0631-42ad-95e2-3c132a79ed6c","number":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-02-08","images":[]},{"id":"f1838613-5de8-4f8e-97b2-e14ebcfc4b50","number":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-01-09","images":[]},{"id":"84c2fd80-8e55-44d3-9fe4-15e89d14657e","number":"47","title":"Chapter